<div class="admin-panel design-editor home-editor">
  <div class="admin-panel-head"><div><p class="kicker dark">Portada editable segura</p><h2>Diseño y contenidos de la home</h2></div><span class="design-state" data-design-state></span></div>
  <p>Edita textos, imágenes, encuadres y orden mediante controles seguros. La vista previa muestra escritorio y móvil antes de publicar.</p>
  <form data-design-form>
    <fieldset><legend>Estilo general</legend><div class="design-options"><label class="field"><span>Fuentes</span><select name="fontPair"><option value="editorial">Editorial — Newsreader + DM Sans</option><option value="classic">Clásica — Georgia</option><option value="modern">Moderna — DM Sans</option><option value="brand">Marca moderna — Archivo</option><option value="lato">Lato — limpia y contemporánea</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Disposición</span><select name="layout"><option value="editorial">Editorial equilibrada</option><option value="compact">Compacta</option><option value="airy">Amplia y respirada</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Logo del encabezado</span><select name="logo"><option value="symbol-text">Símbolo + nombre</option><option value="full">Logo completo</option><option value="symbol">Solo símbolo</option></select></label></div></fieldset>
    <fieldset><legend>Colores</legend><div class="design-colors"><label>Verde principal<input type="color" name="forest" /></label><label>Verde oscuro<input type="color" name="forest2" /></label><label>Fondo<input type="color" name="cream" /></label><label>Tarjetas<input type="color" name="paper" /></label><label>Texto<input type="color" name="ink" /></label><label>Acciones<input type="color" name="clay" /></label><label>Acento<input type="color" name="gold" /></label></div></fieldset>

    <fieldset><legend>Orden y visibilidad de las secciones</legend><p class="field-help">Los tres números deben ser diferentes. Ocultar una sección no borra su contenido.</p><div class="home-section-controls">
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="routesVisible" /> Mostrar rutas <select name="routesOrder" aria-label="Posición de rutas"><option value="1">1ª</option><option value="2">2ª</option><option value="3">3ª</option></select></label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="methodVisible" /> Mostrar método <select name="methodOrder" aria-label="Posición del método"><option value="1">1ª</option><option value="2">2ª</option><option value="3">3ª</option></select></label>
      <label><input type="checkbox" name="partnerVisible" /> Mostrar partners <select name="partnerOrder" aria-label="Posición de partners"><option value="1">1ª</option><option value="2">2ª</option><option value="3">3ª</option></select></label>
    </div></fieldset>

    <details class="home-editor-section" open><summary>Cabecera principal</summary>
      <div class="home-image-editor"><div><label class="field"><span>Reemplazar imagen</span><input name="heroImageFile" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif" /></label><input name="heroImageUrl" type="hidden" /><img data-current-image="hero" alt="Vista previa de la imagen principal" /></div><div class="home-image-controls"><label class="field"><span>Alt castellano</span><input name="heroImageAltEs" maxlength="240" /></label><label class="field"><span>Alt English</span><input name="heroImageAltEn" maxlength="240" /></label><label class="field"><span>Ajuste escritorio</span><select name="heroDesktopFit"><option value="cover">Cubrir</option><option value="contain">Imagen completa</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Ajuste móvil</span><select name="heroMobileFit"><option value="cover">Cubrir</option><option value="contain">Imagen completa</option></select></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco horizontal escritorio <output data-output="heroDesktopX"></output></span><input name="heroDesktopX" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco vertical escritorio <output data-output="heroDesktopY"></output></span><input name="heroDesktopY" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Zoom escritorio <output data-output="heroDesktopZoom"></output></span><input name="heroDesktopZoom" type="range" min="100" max="160" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco horizontal móvil <output data-output="heroMobileX"></output></span><input name="heroMobileX" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco vertical móvil <output data-output="heroMobileY"></output></span><input name="heroMobileY" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Zoom móvil <output data-output="heroMobileZoom"></output></span><input name="heroMobileZoom" type="range" min="100" max="160" /></label></div></div>
      <div class="bilingual-editor"><div><h3>Castellano</h3><label class="field"><span>Antetítulo</span><input name="esHomeKicker" maxlength="100" /></label><label class="field"><span>Título principal</span><input name="esHomeTitle" maxlength="120" /></label><label class="field"><span>Segunda línea destacada</span><input name="esHomeAccent" maxlength="120" /></label><label class="field"><span>Texto de presentación</span><textarea name="esHomeLead" rows="3" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Botones, uno por campo</span><input name="esHeroRoutesLabel" maxlength="60" /><input name="esHeroGuideLabel" maxlength="60" /><input name="esHeroBookLabel" maxlength="60" /></label><label class="field"><span>Indicadores, uno por línea</span><textarea name="esTrustItems" rows="3"></textarea></label></div><div><h3>English</h3><label class="field"><span>Eyebrow</span><input name="enHomeKicker" maxlength="100" /></label><label class="field"><span>Main title</span><input name="enHomeTitle" maxlength="120" /></label><label class="field"><span>Highlighted line</span><input name="enHomeAccent" maxlength="120" /></label><label class="field"><span>Introduction</span><textarea name="enHomeLead" rows="3" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Buttons</span><input name="enHeroRoutesLabel" maxlength="60" /><input name="enHeroGuideLabel" maxlength="60" /><input name="enHeroBookLabel" maxlength="60" /></label><label class="field"><span>Indicators, one per line</span><textarea name="enTrustItems" rows="3"></textarea></label></div></div>
    </details>

    <details class="home-editor-section"><summary>Carrusel de rutas</summary><div class="bilingual-editor"><div><h3>Castellano</h3><label class="field"><span>Antetítulo</span><input name="esRoutesKicker" /></label><label class="field"><span>Título</span><input name="esRoutesTitle" /></label><label class="field"><span>Introducción</span><textarea name="esRoutesIntro" rows="3"></textarea></label></div><div><h3>English</h3><label class="field"><span>Eyebrow</span><input name="enRoutesKicker" /></label><label class="field"><span>Title</span><input name="enRoutesTitle" /></label><label class="field"><span>Introduction</span><textarea name="enRoutesIntro" rows="3"></textarea></label></div></div></details>

    <details class="home-editor-section" open><summary>Un método propio</summary>
      <div class="home-image-editor"><div><label class="field"><span>Reemplazar imagen</span><input name="methodImageFile" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/avif" /></label><input name="methodImageUrl" type="hidden" /><img data-current-image="method" alt="Vista previa de la imagen del método" /></div><div class="home-image-controls"><label class="field"><span>Alt castellano</span><input name="methodImageAltEs" maxlength="240" /></label><label class="field"><span>Alt English</span><input name="methodImageAltEn" maxlength="240" /></label><label class="field"><span>Formato escritorio</span><select name="methodDesktopRatio"><option value="3/2">Horizontal 3:2</option><option value="16/9">Panorámico 16:9</option><option value="4/3">Horizontal 4:3</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Formato móvil</span><select name="methodMobileRatio"><option value="3/2">Horizontal 3:2</option><option value="4/3">Horizontal 4:3</option><option value="1/1">Cuadrado</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Ajuste escritorio</span><select name="methodDesktopFit"><option value="cover">Cubrir</option><option value="contain">Imagen completa</option></select></label><label class="field"><span>Ajuste móvil</span><select name="methodMobileFit"><option value="cover">Cubrir</option><option value="contain">Imagen completa</option></select></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco horizontal escritorio <output data-output="methodDesktopX"></output></span><input name="methodDesktopX" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco vertical escritorio <output data-output="methodDesktopY"></output></span><input name="methodDesktopY" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Zoom escritorio <output data-output="methodDesktopZoom"></output></span><input name="methodDesktopZoom" type="range" min="100" max="160" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco horizontal móvil <output data-output="methodMobileX"></output></span><input name="methodMobileX" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Foco vertical móvil <output data-output="methodMobileY"></output></span><input name="methodMobileY" type="range" min="0" max="100" /></label><label class="range-field"><span>Zoom móvil <output data-output="methodMobileZoom"></output></span><input name="methodMobileZoom" type="range" min="100" max="160" /></label></div></div>
      <div class="bilingual-editor"><div><h3>Castellano</h3><label class="field"><span>Antetítulo</span><input name="esMethodKicker" /></label><label class="field"><span>Frase principal</span><textarea name="esMethodQuote" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Principio 1: etiqueta, título y texto</span><input name="esMethod1Label" /><input name="esMethod1Title" /><textarea name="esMethod1Body" rows="2"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Principio 2</span><input name="esMethod2Label" /><input name="esMethod2Title" /><textarea name="esMethod2Body" rows="2"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Principio 3</span><input name="esMethod3Label" /><input name="esMethod3Title" /><textarea name="esMethod3Body" rows="2"></textarea></label></div><div><h3>English</h3><label class="field"><span>Eyebrow</span><input name="enMethodKicker" /></label><label class="field"><span>Main statement</span><textarea name="enMethodQuote" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Principle 1</span><input name="enMethod1Label" /><input name="enMethod1Title" /><textarea name="enMethod1Body" rows="2"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Principle 2</span><input name="enMethod2Label" /><input name="enMethod2Title" /><textarea name="enMethod2Body" rows="2"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Principle 3</span><input name="enMethod3Label" /><input name="enMethod3Title" /><textarea name="enMethod3Body" rows="2"></textarea></label></div></div>
    </details>

    <details class="home-editor-section"><summary>Hoteles, agencias y grupos</summary><div class="bilingual-editor"><div><h3>Castellano</h3><label class="field"><span>Antetítulo</span><input name="esPartnerKicker" /></label><label class="field"><span>Título</span><input name="esPartnerTitle" /></label><label class="field"><span>Texto</span><textarea name="esPartnerBody" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Botón</span><input name="esPartnerButton" /></label></div><div><h3>English</h3><label class="field"><span>Eyebrow</span><input name="enPartnerKicker" /></label><label class="field"><span>Title</span><input name="enPartnerTitle" /></label><label class="field"><span>Text</span><textarea name="enPartnerBody" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Button</span><input name="enPartnerButton" /></label></div></div></details>

    <details class="home-editor-section"><summary>Contacto</summary><div class="bilingual-editor"><div><h3>Castellano</h3><label class="field"><span>Título</span><input name="esContactTitle" maxlength="120" /></label><label class="field"><span>Introducción</span><textarea name="esContactIntro" rows="2" maxlength="400"></textarea></label></div><div><h3>English</h3><label class="field"><span>Title</span><input name="enContactTitle" maxlength="120" /></label><label class="field"><span>Introduction</span><textarea name="enContactIntro" rows="2" maxlength="400"></textarea></label></div></div></details>

    <fieldset><legend>Vista previa antes de publicar</legend><div class="home-preview-grid"><article class="home-preview home-preview-desktop"><span>Escritorio</span><div class="preview-hero" data-preview-hero="desktop"><img data-preview-hero-image="desktop" alt="" /><div><small data-preview-kicker></small><h3><span data-preview-title></span><em data-preview-accent></em></h3><p data-preview-lead></p></div></div><div class="preview-method"><div><small data-preview-method-kicker></small><strong data-preview-method-quote></strong></div><figure data-preview-method="desktop"><img data-preview-method-image="desktop" alt="" /></figure></div></article><article class="home-preview home-preview-mobile"><span>Móvil</span><div class="preview-hero" data-preview-hero="mobile"><img data-preview-hero-image="mobile" alt="" /><div><small data-preview-kicker-mobile></small><h3><span data-preview-title-mobile></span><em data-preview-accent-mobile></em></h3></div></div><div class="preview-method"><div><small data-preview-method-kicker-mobile></small><strong data-preview-method-quote-mobile></strong></div><figure data-preview-method="mobile"><img data-preview-method-image="mobile" alt="" /></figure></div></article></div></fieldset>
    <p class="admin-error" data-design-message role="status"></p><div class="route-editor-actions"><button class="button outline" type="submit">Guardar borrador</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-design-publish>Publicar en web</button><button class="button outline" type="button" data-design-discard>Descartar borrador</button><button class="admin-recovery-link" type="button" data-design-defaults>Restaurar valores iniciales</button></div>
  </form>
</div>
